I think my first ascension was partly skill but more importantly patience.  It
wasn't obvious good luck since not much that was lucky happened.  I suppose luck
was involved in that none of the standard YAAD things happened, and skill in
that I managed to get through it without accidentally killing myself.

http://tinyurl.com/ys5ww is the YAFAP.  I started with a relatively unpromising
Tourist and no real lucky breaks except getting Vorpal Blade fairly early.

I think most skill in Nethack involves realizing that it is not a real time game
and that nothing will happen if you stop and think a minute or two.  Most YASDs
are due to taking some thoughtless action or failing to take advantage of some
item in your inventory.

